deko3d: compile shaders ahead, in the background.

A shader missing from the DKSH cache compiled on the spot on the ring thread (10-200 ms each on
the console), so a new scene stood on a black screen for many seconds. DestinosNativos::Precompilar
takes shaders to compile on the worker before a draw needs them: the ones a scene being loaded
creates first, then the rest; RenderDk feeds the worker at most two at a time, once per Swap.
Compilar (a draw waiting for its shader) now jumps the worker's queue. --deko_precompilar=false
turns it off.

